KID MIXER-MODER
    CarPlay -> HUD bridge: iAP2 maneuver decode + route-window selection,
    jciCARPLAY process gate + devmgr/msgrcv interposition, the OEM libjcidbus/VBS_NAVI
    HUD transport (reverse-engineered from the OEM libraries with Ghidra), the
    cross-compile Makefile, install scripts and documentation.

Derived code (AGPL-3.0 — the reason this work is AGPL-3.0):

    Trevelopment / Bryan Adams et al. — headunit
        https://github.com/Trevelopment/headunit
        HUD guidance sender (hud/hud_send.*), vendored CMU D-Bus proxies (dbus/),
        and the cross-compile build pattern.

Build dependency (independent third-party, not authored here, its own license):

    lmagder — m3-toolchain (ARM cross-compiler, git submodule)
        https://github.com/lmagder/m3-toolchain
